The directories/font names might be slightly different depending on the
distribution and font, but this _should_ work:

As root, copy the .pcf file(s) to /usr/X11R6/lib/X11/fonts/misc. Change
to that directory and run "mkfontdir" then "xset fp rehash". As a normal
user, starting a new xterm as "xterm -fn vga" should do the trick.

